<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>HEAVEN</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PRYVT</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">BACK TO REALITY</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1yuB0XLliqH7OOijYIF7X4</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.215" end="00:25.485">Forget about what we say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.485" end="00:30.780">The past is all gone, all a waste</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.780" end="00:36.086">Leaving it behind, yesterday</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.086" end="00:41.629">The flowers will bloom till it fades away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.629" end="00:46.877">Stuck with your melodies, it's like they're making fun of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.877" end="00:52.398">Giving me hope, but I'm lost in this dream</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.398" end="00:57.669">I see you through, so perfect and true</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.669" end="01:02.940">My feelings decay when I know it's not you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.940" end="01:08.207">Heaven is where you want me to be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.207" end="01:13.475">They're seeking the finer things but for me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.475" end="01:19.016">All I want is you to be, face to face, smiling back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.016" end="01:24.287">Cause I know at last</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.287" end="01:29.557">Facing unknown, colourful worlds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.557" end="01:34.826">Familiar places, I'll tell you all about it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.826" end="01:40.358">So please don't go far, 'cause wherever you are</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.358" end="01:44.358">My heaven or hell opens up, 'cause you are my only love</p></div></body></tt>